  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Core Systems\r\nNeuro Climate Nexus \u2013 Main AI brain; connects to
    ionosphere\r\nBiosynthetic Heart \u2013 Grown in lab; semi-organic energy source\r\nMemory
    Lattice \u2013 Stores environmental data, weather patterns\r\n\r\nCombat/Utility
    Modules\r\nCryo Gauntlet (L-ARM) \u2013 Cold emissions, ice formation, hurricane
    suppression\r\nSol Cannon (R-ARM) \u2013 Sunlight absorption, smog dispersion,
    heatwave redirection\r\nAtmospheric Vents \u2013 Located on shoulders; release
    purified air or clouds\r\n\r\n Mobility Units\r\nTectonic Stabilizers (Legs)
    \u2013 Ground sensors, shock absorption\r\nOceanic Thrusters (Feet) \u2013 Water
    propulsion for marine deployment\r\nSkywalk Anchors (Back) \u2013 Magneto-gravitational
    wings for limited flight/lift\r\n\r\nBiological Components\r\nLiving Muscle Fibers
    \u2013 Self-healing; cloned from synthetic DNA\r\nSensory Skin Panels \u2013
    Monitor temperature, pressure, humidity\r\nRespiratory Intakes \u2013 Inhale
    ambient air to analyze toxicity\r\n\r\nEnergy & Interface\r\nSolar Spine Array
    \u2013 Backshell lined with solar-absorbing plates\r\nAuxiliary Core Access Port
    \u2013 Emergency shutdown or reboot interface\r\nPilot Sync Interface \u2013
    (Optional) Neural link for human override\r\n\r\nMonitoring & Data\r\nSatellite
    Uplink Node \u2013 Communicates with orbital satellites\r\nGeoScan Module \u2013
    Underground heat and moisture scanning\r\nStormwatch Beacon \u2013 Emits warning
    signals across regions\r\n"
